{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Moore谱"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Moore 谱"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>给定 Abel 群 $G$, 其 Moore 谱 $MG$ 由如下性质刻画:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\pi_{&lt;0}MG \\simeq 0$;</li>\n<li>$\\pi_0 MG \\simeq G$;</li>\n<li>$H_{&gt;0}(MG,\\mathbb{Z})\\simeq 0$, 其中 $H_n(MG,\\mathbb{Z}) \\simeq \\pi_{n}(MG\\wedge H\\mathbb{Z})$, $H\\mathbb{Z}$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eilenberg–MacLane谱","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane 谱"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}